# MusicFlow Cursor Rules

## Project Info
- **Name:** MusicFlow
- **Type:** NAS Music Conversion Tool
- **Stack:** Python (FastAPI) + Vue 3 + Docker
- **Main Feature:** Audio format conversion, metadata processing, file monitoring

---

## Code Style

### Python
- Use type hints
- Add Chinese comments
- Follow PEP 8
- Complete exception handling
- Full logging

### TypeScript/Vue
- Use Composition API
- Use TypeScript types
- PascalCase for components
- camelCase for variables

---

## Git Rules

### Branch Naming
```
feature/<name>    # New feature
fix/<name>        # Bug fix
refactor/<name>   # Refactor
docs/<name>       # Documentation
```

### Commit Format
```
<type>: <description>

Types: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | test | perf | build | ci | chore
```

### Examples
```
feat: add batch conversion
fix: resolve metadata error
refactor: simplify engine
```

---

## Work Flow

1. Check git status
2. Create feature branch
3. Make changes
4. Show git diff
5. Wait for user confirmation
6. Commit changes

---

## Restrictions

###禁止操作
- git reset --hard
- git push --force
- Delete remote branches
- Modify history
- Auto commit (need user confirmation)
- Modify unrelated code
- Auto upgrade dependencies

---

## Security

### 禁止提交
- .env files
- Passwords, tokens, keys
- Log files
- Database backups

---

## Testing

### 必须验证
- Code runs without errors
- API endpoints respond correctly
- Frontend pages display correctly
- No syntax errors

---

## Documentation

### 必须更新
- Code comments (key parts)
- API documentation (if changed)
- CHANGELOG.md (important changes)

---

## Work Completion

### 输出格式
```markdown
## Summary
Changes: xxx

## Files Changed
- file1
- file2

## Tests
- test results

## Git Status
- clean / modified

## Next Steps
- suggestions
```

---

## Project Structure

```
MusicFlow/
├── backend/        # Python backend
├── frontend/       # Vue 3 frontend
├── docs/          # Documentation
├── CLAUDE.md      # AI coding rules
└── AGENTS.md      # Agent rules
```

---

## Dev Environment

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8082
```

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Access
- Frontend: http://localhost:3000
- Backend: http://localhost:8082
- API Docs: http://localhost:8082/docs

---

## Key Features

- Audio format conversion (FLAC, MP3, M4A, AAC, ALAC)
- Metadata and cover art preservation
- Multi-version output
- File monitoring with stability detection
- Async task queue with concurrency control
- Web UI for management

---

## Constraints

- Do not modify main/master directly
- Do not commit without user confirmation
- Do not modify unrelated code
- Do not upgrade dependencies without asking
- Always explain why when making changes

---

## Quality Standards

### Code Quality
- Type hints required
- Comments in Chinese
- Exception handling
- Logging complete
- No hardcoded values

### Testing
- API testing
- Frontend testing
- Conversion testing

---

**遵循这些规则，确保代码质量和项目可维护性。**
